    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist now!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/58c70e13bf79bc2b622797e3b6ff9a34.poster.avif?t=1754568418\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/58c70e13bf79bc2b622797e3b6ff9a34.webm?t=1754568418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/58c70e13bf79bc2b622797e3b6ff9a34.mp4?t=1754568418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Tactical domino placement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the highest possible score by expanding your domino web. Unfold the cosmic plane and optimise your domino placing route to collect as many resources as you can.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/062a1880eee3312515e1313714e2787b.poster.avif?t=1754568418\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/062a1880eee3312515e1313714e2787b.webm?t=1754568418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/062a1880eee3312515e1313714e2787b.mp4?t=1754568418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage the cosmic plane</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bigger your domino web, the more vulnerable you become. Each turn the plane changes so you will have to improvise to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/7d382234ad5fb2ec5ef0e540597ca21c.poster.avif?t=1754568418\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/7d382234ad5fb2ec5ef0e540597ca21c.webm?t=1754568418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/7d382234ad5fb2ec5ef0e540597ca21c.mp4?t=1754568418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage your resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cash, upgrade your deck and buy Nova Cards to create crazy synergies and tactical variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/bbeba5162c6524aba52e9344db35b17b.poster.avif?t=1754568418\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/bbeba5162c6524aba52e9344db35b17b.webm?t=1754568418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/bbeba5162c6524aba52e9344db35b17b.mp4?t=1754568418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Satisfying visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a cosmic dance of colors and special effects. The higher you score, the more visually exciting the dance becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/561a39129c3b36646ec6f9a3b13833a5.poster.avif?t=1754568418\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/561a39129c3b36646ec6f9a3b13833a5.webm?t=1754568418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/561a39129c3b36646ec6f9a3b13833a5.mp4?t=1754568418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic board elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the cosmic elements have an effect on eachother. Fire, explosives, ice, electricity, darkness, water and more. This makes every new playthrough dynamic and different.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 upgradable domino pieces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150 unique Nova Cards that alter the game significantly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unlockable decks with each their own difficulty level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 unlockable challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily playthroughs with leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive visual effects that will make you want to come back over and over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist now!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/58c70e13bf79bc2b622797e3b6ff9a34.poster.avif?t=1754568418\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/58c70e13bf79bc2b622797e3b6ff9a34.webm?t=1754568418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/58c70e13bf79bc2b622797e3b6ff9a34.mp4?t=1754568418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Tactical domino placement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the highest possible score by expanding your domino web. Unfold the cosmic plane and optimise your domino placing route to collect as many resources as you can.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/062a1880eee3312515e1313714e2787b.poster.avif?t=1754568418\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/062a1880eee3312515e1313714e2787b.webm?t=1754568418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/062a1880eee3312515e1313714e2787b.mp4?t=1754568418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage the cosmic plane</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bigger your domino web, the more vulnerable you become. Each turn the plane changes so you will have to improvise to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/7d382234ad5fb2ec5ef0e540597ca21c.poster.avif?t=1754568418\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/7d382234ad5fb2ec5ef0e540597ca21c.webm?t=1754568418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/7d382234ad5fb2ec5ef0e540597ca21c.mp4?t=1754568418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage your resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cash, upgrade your deck and buy Nova Cards to create crazy synergies and tactical variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/bbeba5162c6524aba52e9344db35b17b.poster.avif?t=1754568418\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/bbeba5162c6524aba52e9344db35b17b.webm?t=1754568418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/bbeba5162c6524aba52e9344db35b17b.mp4?t=1754568418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Satisfying visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a cosmic dance of colors and special effects. The higher you score, the more visually exciting the dance becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/561a39129c3b36646ec6f9a3b13833a5.poster.avif?t=1754568418\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/561a39129c3b36646ec6f9a3b13833a5.webm?t=1754568418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399130/extras/561a39129c3b36646ec6f9a3b13833a5.mp4?t=1754568418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic board elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the cosmic elements have an effect on eachother. Fire, explosives, ice, electricity, darkness, water and more. This makes every new playthrough dynamic and different.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 upgradable domino pieces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150 unique Nova Cards that alter the game significantly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unlockable decks with each their own difficulty level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 unlockable challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily playthroughs with leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive visual effects that will make you want to come back over and over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Collect and chain dominoes together: the longer the chain, the higher you score. Amplify your score-breaking engine through various upgrades, while also navigating through a volatile board full of hazards and loot in this highly tactical domino deckbuilder.",
